\ help.ff  --  Lavarenne's self-executing help file mechanism
\ The search engine lives in ff.help's preamble (lines 7-16).
\ needed loads ff.help into tib; eval runs the preamble which
\ searches the remaining tib content for the keyword.
" help" features append
: help`
  wsparse 0= IF 2drop "help" THEN
  [` 2>r "ff.help" needed 2r> _] 0;
  !"no_help_found_for_this_word"
